The MIT License above covers this app's own code. The app image also contains
MAME, compiled to WebAssembly, which is NOT covered by it:

MAME - Copyright (c) the MAME team and contributors - licensed under the GNU
General Public License version 2 or later. The license text is in the image at
/app/mame/COPYING. The source code of the exact version used is at
https://github.com/mamedev/mame (the release tag is in mame/Dockerfile and
Dockerfile), and mame/ in this repository holds everything needed to build it
the same way, including the one patch applied (mame/save-settings.patch). The hiscore plugin that comes with MAME is CC0, its plugin
loader (boot.lua) BSD-3-Clause and its json plugin MIT.

---

Third-party components in the app image, under their own licences (not the MIT licence
above): MAME, GNU GPL version 2 or later (https://github.com/mamedev/mame), with its
plugins (hiscore: CC0; boot.lua: BSD-3-Clause; json: MIT); the hi2txt high score
definitions by GreatStone, GNU GPL version 2 (https://github.com/GreatStoneEx/hi2txt-xml);
and the app's decoder for them, src/hiscores.py, GNU GPL version 2 or later (it follows
MAME's data_hiscore.lua). See DOCS.md, "Legal and licenses".
